      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::web::016::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature toughness in fusion plasma-facing structural materials is governed by a three-dimensional twin network.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::web::002::body",
        "PMC5321736::web::016::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A three-dimensional hierarchical twin network can form within individual grains.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::web::016::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The twin network presents substantial barriers to dislocation motion.",
